<section class="posts-section" aria-labelledby="constellations-title">
  <h1 class="posts-title" id="constellations-title">constellations</h1>
  <p class="posts-intro">Constellations reveal connections across works through recurring motifs, themes, and ideas. Unlike collections, they are overlapping paths of relation rather than deliberate groupings; a work can belong to more than one.</p>
  <ul class="constellation-list">
    {% for constellation in collections.constellationPages %}
    <li>
      <h2><a href="/constellations/{{ constellation.slug }}/">{{ constellation.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ constellation.introduction }}</p>
      <p>{{ constellation.artworks.length }} artwork{% if constellation.artworks.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
